{
  "info": {
    "name": "Integriq \u2014 declared data feeds (gateway-declared-data-feeds)",
    "description": "Newman tests of tasks 2 and 3 of openspec/changes/gateway-declared-data-feeds, against shillinq's declared feed `accounts` (GET /api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts):\n\n- paging: `$top`, `@odata.nextLink` with `$skip`, the next page is another record; only declared fields; `$select`; `$filter` with `eq`; `$orderby` and an undeclared field answer 400; POST answers 405.\n- scope (two consumers): a consumer bound to one administration reads it and is refused (403) for another, also through `$filter`; a consumer without a binding is refused (403); no key is 401.\n\nThe feeds come from shillinq's own lib/Settings/feeds.json, synced at the start. When shillinq is not installed, every feed check is reported as skipped, not passed. The two consumers get fresh API keys per run and are deleted in teardown.\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2\nSPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Conduction B.V. <info@conduction.nl>",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sync every enabled app's feeds.json (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "OCS-APIRequest",
                "value": "true"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/feeds/sync",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Setup: sync answers 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Is shillinq's accounts feed declared?",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "OCS-APIRequest",
                "value": "true"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/integriq/endpoint?endpoint=feeds/shillinq/accounts",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Setup: endpoint list readable', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const results = pm.response.json().results || [];",
                  "// The feeds come from shillinq's own feeds.json. Without shillinq on this instance",
                  "// there is nothing to read, and every feed check below is reported as skipped.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('feedsPresent', results.length > 0 ? 'true' : 'false');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Pick an administration that has accounts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "OCS-APIRequest",
                "value": "true"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/shillinq/Account?_limit=1",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Fresh keys per run, so a key from an earlier run cannot answer for this one.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('feedKeyBound', 'newman-feed-bound-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('feedKeyUnbound', 'newman-feed-unbound-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const ok = pm.response.code === 200;",
                  "const first = ok ? ((pm.response.json().results || [])[0] || {}) : {};",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('feedAdministration', String(first.administrationId || 'newman-administration-a'));",
                  "pm.test('Setup: an administration to bind to', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('feedAdministration')).to.have.length.above(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create the consumer bound to that administration",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "OCS-APIRequest",
                "value": "true"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/integriq/consumer",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"newman-feed-consumer-bound\",\n  \"description\": \"Newman data-feed consumer bound to one administration\",\n  \"authorizationType\": \"apiKey\",\n  \"authorizationConfiguration\": { \"apiKey\": \"{{feedKeyBound}}\" },\n  \"feedScopes\": { \"shillinq\": [\"{{feedAdministration}}\"] }\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Setup: bound consumer created', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.below(300));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('feedConsumerBound', b.id || (b['@self'] || {}).id || '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create the consumer without a binding",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "OCS-APIRequest",
                "value": "true"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/integriq/consumer",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"newman-feed-consumer-unbound\",\n  \"description\": \"Newman data-feed consumer without a feed binding\",\n  \"authorizationType\": \"apiKey\",\n  \"authorizationConfiguration\": { \"apiKey\": \"{{feedKeyUnbound}}\" }\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Setup: unbound consumer created', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.below(300));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('feedConsumerUnbound', b.id || (b['@self'] || {}).id || '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Paging and field selection (task 2)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "First page, one record at a time",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?$top=1",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('A page: 200 with value and a next link', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(b.value).to.be.an('array').with.length.at.most(1);",
                  "    if (b.value.length === 1) { pm.expect(b['@odata.nextLink'], 'next link').to.include('%24skip=1'); }",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('feedFirst', JSON.stringify(b.value[0] || null));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('feedNext', b['@odata.nextLink'] || '');",
                  "});",
                  "check('Only declared fields come back', () => {",
                  "    const declared = ['accountNumber', 'name', 'accountType', 'parentAccountNumber', 'rgsCode'];",
                  "    (pm.response.json().value || []).forEach((row) => Object.keys(row).forEach((k) => pm.expect(declared, k).to.include(k)));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Follow the next link",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{feedNextOrSelf}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.variables.set('feedNextOrSelf', pm.collectionVariables.get('feedNext') || pm.variables.replaceIn('{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?$top=1&$skip=1'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('The next page is another record', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const second = (pm.response.json().value || [])[0] || null;",
                  "    const first = JSON.parse(pm.collectionVariables.get('feedFirst') || 'null');",
                  "    if (first && second) { pm.expect(JSON.stringify(second)).to.not.eql(JSON.stringify(first)); }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "$select narrows to declared fields",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?$top=5&$select=accountNumber,name",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('$select: only accountNumber and name', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    (pm.response.json().value || []).forEach((row) => pm.expect(Object.keys(row).sort()).to.eql(['accountNumber', 'name']));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "$filter eq on a declared field",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?$filter=accountType eq '{{feedAccountType}}'",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const first = JSON.parse(pm.collectionVariables.get('feedFirst') || 'null') || {};",
                  "pm.variables.set('feedAccountType', String(first.accountType || 'newman-none'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('$filter: every row has that account type', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const want = pm.variables.get('feedAccountType');",
                  "    (pm.response.json().value || []).forEach((row) => pm.expect(String(row.accountType)).to.eql(want));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "$orderby is not supported (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?$orderby=name",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('$orderby: 400 naming it', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('$orderby');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "$select of an undeclared field (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?$select=iban",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('Undeclared field: 400 naming it', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('iban');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "A feed is read-only (405 on POST)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('POST on a feed: 405', () => pm.response.to.have.status(405));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Consumer scope (task 3)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "The bound consumer asks for its own administration",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?administrationId={{feedAdministration}}&$top=5",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('Own administration: 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "The bound consumer asks for another administration (403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?administrationId=newman-another-administration",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('Another administration: 403 scope_not_allowed', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('scope_not_allowed');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "The bound consumer asks for another administration in $filter (403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyBound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?$filter=administrationId eq 'newman-another-administration'",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('Another administration through $filter: 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "The consumer without a binding (403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "{{feedKeyUnbound}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/integriq/api/endpoint/feeds/shillinq/accounts?$top=1",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const present = pm.collectionVariables.get('feedsPresent') === 'true';",
                  "const check = present ? pm.test : pm.test.skip;",
                  "check('No binding: 403 scope_not_allowed', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('scope_not_allowed');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
